1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:12,320
An Iranian strike damaged a Kuwaiti power and desalination plant, exposing how vulnerable Gulf water systems are during conflict, according to AP.

2
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:18,594
Kuwait and other dry countries depend heavily on desalination for drinking water.

3
00:00:18,594 --> 00:00:28,197
The attack shows that regional escalation can threaten civilian life even when the immediate target appears to be strategic infrastructure.

